== Icelandic ==
===Etymology===
From ''[[þrír]]'' "[[three]]" + ''[[tíu]]'' "[[ten]]", meaning '''three ten'''.
=== Cardinal number ===

'''þrjátíu''' {{indecl}}

# [[thirty]], cardinal number after [[tuttugu og níu]] and before [[þrjátíu og einn]]

